    "description":  "Temple Girl Kids brings the stories behind India\u0027s temples to your child\u0027s bedtime — as audio stories narrated by Namratha Mohan.\nNamratha, known as The Temple Girl, has spent years travelling across India documenting the stories, rituals, and traditions of its greatest temples. Now she tells those stories for children — in her own voice.\nEvery story begins at a real temple. Your child will hear how a tiny fish saved the entire world at Srirangam. How a boy named Krishna stole butter from every pot in Vrindavan and ended up at Guruvayur. How an eagle flew through fire and serpents to free his mother. How a little boy named Markandeya held on to Shiva and defeated death itself. These are not simplified retellings — they are vivid, immersive audio stories rooted in India\u0027s living temple traditions.\nWHAT YOUR CHILD GETS\nA growing library of audio stories across multiple categories: Krishna, Vishnu, Shiva, Rama, Hanuman, Ganesha, Devi, Murugan, and Others.\nNew stories added regularly.\nEvery story is an audio experience — professionally narrated by Namratha in her warm, signature storytelling style.\nA 1-minute free preview of every story.\nBUILT FOR FAMILIES\nNo advertisements — ever.\nSafe, screen-free listening — just press play and put the phone down.\nEvery story connects to a real temple your family can visit.\nHOW IT WORKS\nBrowse and preview any story for free. Members with active access can listen to full-length stories and Temple Girl Radio.\nABOUT TEMPLE GIRL\nWhat started as one woman\u0027s journey through India\u0027s temples has grown into a movement to make temple heritage accessible to everyone. Temple Girl Kids is the next step — making sure the next generation grows up hearing these stories.\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nFollow us: @thetemplegirl on Instagram.\nQuestions or feedback? Email us at support@templegirl.com.",
